<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English soccer matches</p>
<p>on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Premier league </p>
<p> Coventry	 2     Newcastle	     1</p>
<p> Liverpool	4     Nottingham Forest   2</p>
<p>F.A. Cup second round replays</p>
<p>Burnley	   0     Walsall		 1</p>
<p>(match abandoned at halftime due to floolight failure)</p>
<p> Peterborough   4  Enfield		    1</p>
<p>(Peterborough away to Plymouth in third round)</p>
<p> Wycombe	  3     Barnet		  2</p>
<p>(Wycombe home to Bradford)</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Bradford	 0     Reading		 0</p>
<p> Crystal Palace 0     Sheffield United    1</p>
<p>Add English F.A. Cup second round</p>
<p> Scunthorpe     2  Wrexham     3</p>
<p>(after extra time. 90 mins: 2-2. Wrexham home to West Ham in</p>
<p>third round</p>
